OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK group leader resigns    
OL,4,Afrom party                             
OL,6,FThe leader of a group of Reform UK     
OL,7,Fcouncillors has become the fourth      
OL,8,Fperson to resign from the party in a   
OL,9,Fweek.                                  
OL,11,FRick Baker became leader of            
OL,12,FNorthumberland County Council's Reform 
OL,13,Fopposition group in May, but the Cowpen
OL,14,Fward councillor is now sitting as a    
OL,15,F"non-aligned" member. Councillors David
OL,16,FSwinhoe, Steven Roberts and David      
OL,17,FFitzgerald all left the party in recent
OL,18,Fdays.                                  
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
