OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK group leader resigns    
OL,4,Afrom party                             
OL,6,FIn a message published online, Baker   
OL,7,Fsaid he still backed Reform nationally 
OL,8,Fbut explained: "My issues are purely   
OL,9,Flocal."                                
OL,11,FReform accused its former members of   
OL,12,F"betraying" voters and suggested       
OL,13,F"personal ambitions" to contest        
OL,14,Fparliamentary seats were behind the    
OL,15,Fresignations.                          
